<Layout title="Confidence grows with the right support"><section class="hero"><div><p class="eyebrow">PERSONALISED TUTORING · AGES 11–16</p><h1>Small steps.<br/>Stronger skills.<br/><em>More confidence.</em></h1><p class="intro">Academic support built around your child, with a plan shaped together with your family.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button" href="/contact/">Find your starting point ↗</a><a class="text-link" href="/services/">Explore our support →</a></div><p class="local"><span></span> For families across Leicestershire</p></div><div class="hero-art"><img src="/images/study.svg" alt="Illustration of a calm study desk with books, a learning plan and a plant" width="640" height="620"/><div class="art-note"><span>01 / A PLAN THAT FITS</span><strong>Your child.<br/>Their own way forward.</strong></div></div></section><section class="ribbon"><span>GCSE preparation</span><span>Secondary school support</span><span>Personalised learning plans</span></section><section class="section split"><div><p class="eyebrow">Support with purpose</p><h2>There’s more to progress<br/>than the next exam.</h2></div><div><p class="intro">Sometimes it’s a topic that hasn’t clicked. Sometimes it’s knowing how to revise. We start by listening, then agree achievable targets and a personalised plan.</p><p>Our focus is children aged 11–16: building understanding through secondary school and preparing for GCSEs. If you’re looking for SATs preparation, please ask us about age suitability and availability.</p><a class="text-link" href="/services/">How we can help →</a></div></section><section class="section tint"><p class="eyebrow">A simple, thoughtful approach</p><h2>A shared plan. A steady rhythm.</h2><div class="grid three"><article><span class="step">01</span><h3>Meet & listen</h3><p>We talk with your family about strengths, challenges and the outcomes that matter to you.</p></article><article><span class="step">02</span><h3>Set the direction</h3><p>Together, we agree tutoring targets and build a learning plan around your child’s starting point.</p></article><article><span class="step">03</span><h3>Learn & review</h3><p>Agree an hourly session schedule, work through the plan and review progress together.</p></article></div></section><section class="section"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">People make the difference</p><h2>Get to know your support.</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/tutors/">About our tutors →</a></div><div class="feature"><span class="big-letter">Aa</span><div><h3>Clear explanations. Room to ask questions.</h3><p>Our approach puts individual goals at the centre, with time to revisit topics and develop independent study habits. Tutor details will be added before launch.</p></div></div></section></Layout>
